{"nodes": [{"id": "analiz_workflowengine_tek_motor", "label": "WorkflowEngine \u2014 Tek \u0130\u015f Ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 Motoru", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ANALIZ.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "analiz_flowrouter_deterministik_baypas", "label": "FlowRouter \u2014 Deterministik Orkestrat\u00f6r Baypas\u0131", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ANALIZ.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Aktif i\u015f ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 varken mesaj hi\u00e7bir ko\u015fulda orkestrat\u00f6re u\u011framaz; \u00f6deme ortas\u0131ndaki kullan\u0131c\u0131 LLM ak\u0131l y\u00fcr\u00fctmesiyle ak\u0131\u015ftan \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131lamaz."}, {"id": "analiz_session_tek_kapi", "label": "Oturum \u2014 Tek Kap\u0131, Tek Okuma/Tek Yazma", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ANALIZ.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "T\u00fcm oturum verisi yaln\u0131zca SessionContext \u00fczerinden okunur; ISessionStore'un tek \u00e7a\u011f\u0131ran\u0131 AmbientSessionAccessor'd\u0131r."}, {"id": "analiz_responsesanitizer_6_katman", "label": "ResponseSanitizer \u2014 6 Katmanl\u0131 \u00c7\u0131kt\u0131 Bariyeri", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ANALIZ.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Her yan\u0131t tek \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f noktas\u0131ndan (GatewayService.FinalizeResponse) ge\u00e7er; deterministik regex temizli\u011fi g\u00fcvenlik s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 olarak ele al\u0131n\u0131r."}, {"id": "analiz_schemavalidatedslotwriter_sema_kapisi", "label": "SchemaValidatedSlotWriter \u2014 \u015eema Kap\u0131s\u0131", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ANALIZ.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "update_slot'un tek ge\u00e7i\u015f noktas\u0131; \u015femaya uymayan de\u011fer yaz\u0131lmaz, d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcr\u00fclmez."}, {"id": "analiz_requestport_hitl_onay_kapisi", "label": "RequestPort \u2014 HITL Onay Kap\u0131s\u0131", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "ANALIZ.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Finansal etkisi olan her i\u015flem RequestPort ile kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k onay\u0131n\u0131 bekler; LLM paray\u0131 do\u011frudan hareket ettiremez."}, {"id": "analiz_semanticindex_esik_tablosu", "label": "SemanticIndex \u2014 Kay\u0131t T\u00fcr\u00fcne G\u00f6re Farkl\u0131 E\u015fik", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "ANALIZ.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "E\u015fikler bilerek farkl\u0131d\u0131r: ak\u0131\u015f 0.5 (aday listesi), mkCode/kampanya 0.70, finansman 0.65 \u2014 her biri sonucun kullan\u0131m bi\u00e7imine g\u00f6re kalibre edilir."}, {"id": "analiz_toolregistry_auto_discovery", "label": "ToolRegistry \u2014 Otomatik Ke\u015fif ve Fail-Fast Do\u011frulama", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ANALIZ.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Kay\u0131tl\u0131 ara\u00e7lar ile canl\u0131 MCP listesi ayr\u0131\u015f\u0131rsa a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131\u015fta patlar; uyu\u015fmazl\u0131k ba\u011flant\u0131 kurulumunda yakalan\u0131r, ilk \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131da de\u011fil."}, {"id": "analiz_specialistcatalog_lazy_eviction", "label": "SpecialistCatalog \u2014 Tembel Kurulum + Bo\u015fta Tahliye", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "ANALIZ.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Uzman ajanlar ilk istekte kurulur, IMemoryCache