z\u00fcmden \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda Banking.Host'un h\u00e2l\u00e2 derlenmesi gerekir; bankaya giden yap\u0131sal ba\u011flar\u0131n kesik kald\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 do\u011frular."}, {"id": "analiz_hitl_idempotency", "label": "Idempotency Anahtar\u0131 \u2014 \u00c7ift T\u0131klama Korumas\u0131", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "ANALIZ.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ayn\u0131 teklif i\u00e7in hesaplanan parmak izi motor taraf\u0131ndan oturuma yaz\u0131l\u0131r, executor ayn\u0131 de\u011feri bankaya Idempotency-Key olarak g\u00f6nderir."}, {"id": "analiz_topiccontextprovider_baglamsal_devamlilik", "label": "TopicContextProvider \u2014 \u00d6nceki Tur Ba\u011flam\u0131", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ANALIZ.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Zamirli takip c\u00fcmlelerinin g\u00f6ndergesi \u00f6nceki turun yan\u0131t\u0131ndan \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcl\u00fcr; start_workflow/open_screen tetiklendi\u011finde ba\u011flam temizlenir."}, {"id": "analiz_declarative_workflow_yaml_tek_yol", "label": "YAML \u2014 Tek \u0130\u015f Ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 Kay\u0131t Yolu", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ANALIZ.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Yeni bir ak\u0131\u015f eklemek YAML dosyas\u0131 yazmaktan ibarettir; C# record'u, ak\u0131\u015fa \u00f6zel executor, attribute veya DI kayd\u0131 gerekmez."}, {"id": "analiz_a2a_vs_inprocess_toggle", "label": "A2A vs. S\u00fcre\u00e7 \u0130\u00e7i \u2014 \u00c7al\u0131\u015fma Zaman\u0131 Anahtar\u0131", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ANALIZ.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "AgentOptions.UseA2AForSpecialists orkestrat\u00f6r\u00fcn 